<title>ITALY: Italy's April tax revenue down 3.3 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Italy's April tax revenue down 3.3 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's tax revenue was 38.918 trillion lire in April, down 3.3 percent year-on-year, the Finance Ministry said on Thursday.</p>
<p>It said January-April 1997 tax revenue was up 2.2 percent against the same period of 1996 at 150.553 trillion lire.</p>
<p>-- Rome newsroom +396 678 2501</p>
